Objectives:
  1. To Emit a 10-microsecond high pulse via the trigger pin to initiate an ultrasonic sound wave signal from the sensor.
  2. To Measure the travel time (duration) of the reflected echo signal returning to pin 10 using the pulseIn() function.
  3. To Calculate the target distance using the formula distance = (duration * 0.034)/2 and print the result in centimeters to the Virtual Terminal.
